<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Image Editing Benchmark</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We additionally evaluate on the recent <span id="A2.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GEdit-Bench</span> full set. As shown in Tab. <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ B.3 Image Editing Benchmark ‣ Appendix B More Results ‣ CoLoGen: Progressive Learning of Concept–Localization Duality for Unified Image Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>, CoLoGen achieves the best G_SC score and remains competitive across other editing quality metrics, demonstrating strong generalization ability in image editing tasks.</p>
</div>
